["create","CRDWVVRFY",1780769801,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Coordinator Per-Wave Verification Gate","type":"story","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-worker/SKILL.md"],"definition_of_done":"The coordinator skill records a wave manifest (WAVE_TASK_IDS, WAVE_BASE_SHA, story branch, wave type) before dispatch, runs an explicit Wave Verification Gate after each wave integrates (with code and docs-skill-only gate profiles, bounded 2-attempt remediation, and arm doctor), and the worker skill has a mandatory pre-transition checklist requiring go build ./... and make check to be green before transitioning to done. All deployed skills contain the required terms. make check passes.","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","CRDWVVRFY-T1",1780769801,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Add wave manifest recording to coordinator skill","parent":"CRDWVVRFY","type":"task","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md"],"acceptance":["SKILL.md contains WAVE_TASK_IDS and WAVE_BASE_SHA capture step before dispatch","Wave type classification (code vs docs-skill-only) and auto-promotion rule present","make validate-skills exits 0"],"definition_of_done":"The coordinator SKILL.md has a wave manifest step before the dispatch loop that records WAVE_TASK_IDS (exact task IDs in order), WAVE_BASE_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD), the story branch name, and the wave type classification (code vs docs-skill-only). The wave type auto-promotion rule is documented: if the diff contains any *.go, go.mod, go.sum, Makefile, cmd/, or internal/ files outside skillsembed, promote to the code profile. make validate-skills passes.","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","CRDWVVRFY-T2",1780769801,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Add Wave Verification Gate section to coordinator skill","parent":"CRDWVVRFY","type":"task","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md"],"acceptance":["SKILL.md contains a section titled 'Wave Verification Gate'","SKILL.md references WAVE_BASE_SHA in changed-file computation","SKILL.md references arm doctor in gate profile","SKILL.md specifies bounded remediation with at most 2 attempts and escalation","SKILL.md documents go run ./cmd/armature fallback","make validate-skills exits 0"],"definition_of_done":"The coordinator SKILL.md has a 'Wave Verification Gate' section placed after integration and before arm ready. It includes: (1) terminal-state check scoped to WAVE_TASK_IDS using arm list --terminal --parent; (2) code wave gate profile: go build ./..., make lint test coverage-check validate-skills build, arm validate --quiet, arm doctor; (3) docs-skill-only gate profile: conditional make validate-skills, arm validate --quiet, arm doctor; (4) changed-file set computed from git diff --name-only \"$WAVE_BASE_SHA\"..HEAD; (5) bounded remediation: at most 2 foreground attempts, exact prompt contents (failing command, raw output, WAVE_TASK_IDS, WAVE_BASE_SHA, diff, story branch, worker skill reference, edit-scope instruction, conditional TDD rule), then escalation if still red; (6) source-backed arm fallback via go run ./cmd/armature. make validate-skills passes.","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
